{"3102370": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Fixer Undercover", "steam_appid": 3102370, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102370/extras/8faab9a449184dd812084df8e7369049.poster.avif?t=1784223035\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102370/extras/8faab9a449184dd812084df8e7369049.webm?t=1784223035\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Forget the agent suit. Grab your toolbox. Go Undercover!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🔧 SOLVE WITH YOUR HANDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102370/extras/2b8607c0b2492ed96bb0eab390e39795.poster.avif?t=1784223035\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102370/extras/2b8607c0b2492ed96bb0eab390e39795.webm?t=1784223035\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unscrew a panel, reroute the power and grind through a hatch. Smash what's in the way. Cells, canteens, maintenance corridors — all part of the puzzle. Sometimes you crack it with your brain, sometimes with a hammer. <strong>Think smart or hit hard. Both migh</strong>t work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seven chapters. Five tools. Zero gadgets. Just you, your wits, and whatever you find lying around.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🤖 MEET WINSTON</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102370/extras/429d2fce2a56437997ca01ef4b256e2b.poster.avif?t=1784223035\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102370/extras/429d2fce2a56437997ca01ef4b256e2b.webm?t=1784223035\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your drone partner. Hacker, scout, intel source — and the sharpest mouth in any prison. He'll come through when it matters. Probably.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🔒 THE SETUP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102370/extras/11a6ee23c302424bcb7c3c30a8f8ca83.poster.avif?t=1784223035\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102370/extras/11a6ee23c302424bcb7c3c30a8f8ca83.webm?t=1784223035\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Redemption Prison. A model facility where Warden Viktor Kozlov runs his &quot;Born Again&quot; rehabilitation program. Officially — he turns criminals into new people. Unofficially — he brainwashes them. Your mission? Go in undercover as a regular maintenance worker, fix what needs fixing, and gather evidence against Kozlov along the way. <strong>Nobody suspects the guy with a toolbox.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⭐ PRESS &amp; PLAYERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;One of the best VR puzzle games I have played. I recommend it without hesitation.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>— Duuro Plays</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;A highly entertaining spy caper and a worthy addition to any puzzle lover's library.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>— UploadVR</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Gameplay mechanics shine right from the start. Each room is brimming with hidden secrets.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>— Gaming Hybrid</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102370/extras/c316f17624c545067619ac0575cbd3e0.poster.avif?t=1784223035\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102370/extras/c316f17624c545067619ac0575cbd3e0.webm?t=1784223035\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🎮 WHAT YOU GET</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>7 chapters</strong> — 6 to 8 hours of handcrafted puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5 core tools</strong> + improvised gear from the environment </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enhanced PC visuals</strong> — upgraded beyond the Quest original</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play your way</strong> — full VR with haptics or flat-screen with keyboard/mouse</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🕶️ VR COMFORT</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smooth or Teleport locomotion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smooth or Snap turning </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjustable motion vignettes </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seated, standing. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102370/extras/878b2b8ee40cd34656013fffb9a53be0.poster.avif?t=1784223035\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102370/extras/878b2b8ee40cd34656013fffb9a53be0.webm?t=1784223035\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102370/extras/c1d3a69f54d2b6ad1f3a52e2be0d42c4.poster.avif?t=1784223035\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102370/extras/c1d3a69f54d2b6ad1f3a52e2be0d42c4.webm?t=1784223035\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Infiltrate. Improvise. Expose.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>From former escape room designers who know that the best puzzles give you that feeling of satisfaction and genius when you solve them.</i></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102370/extras/8faab9a449184dd812084df8e7369049.poster.avif?t=1784223035\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102370/extras/8faab9a449184dd812084df8e7369049.webm?t=1784223035\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Forget the agent suit. Grab your toolbox. Go Undercover!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🔧 SOLVE WITH YOUR HANDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102370/extras/2b8607c0b2492ed96bb0eab390e39795.poster.avif?t=1784223035\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102370/extras/2b8607c0b2492ed96bb0eab390e39795.w