riminals into new people. Unofficially — he brainwashes them. Your mission? Go in undercover as a regular maintenance worker, fix what needs fixing, and gather evidence against Kozlov along the way. <strong>Nobody suspects the guy with a toolbox.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⭐ PRESS &amp; PLAYERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;One of the best VR puzzle games I have played. I recommend it without hesitation.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>— Duuro Plays</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;A highly entertaining spy caper and a worthy addition to any puzzle lover's library.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>— UploadVR</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Gameplay mechanics shine right from the start. Each room is brimming with hidden secrets.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>— Gaming Hybrid</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102370/extras/c316f17624c545067619ac0575cbd3e0.poster.avif?t=1784223035\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102370/extras/c316f17624c545067619ac0575cbd3e0.webm?t=1784223035\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🎮 WHAT YOU GET</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>7 chapters</strong> — 6 to 8 hours of handcrafted puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5 core tools</strong> + improvised gear from the environment </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enhanced PC visuals</strong> — upgraded beyond the Quest original</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play your way</strong> — full VR with haptics or flat-screen with keyboard/mouse</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🕶️ VR COMFORT</strong></h2><ul